Z||000008||rockcrawl||06-28-2001||04:17 PM||||The stock pipe on the PFI engines is 2.5". The 4.1 TBIs were 2.25". I think the Fiero exhaust would be a bit restrictive. I'm using 2.5 on mine.<BR> Sorry I can't help you with turbo selection.<P>Roy,<BR> I've got someone working on hacking the Caddy computer code. Superchips says they can make it work. Fastchips also has it listed on their site. If none of them can make it run properly, I'll just use an F-body ECM. There's no way I'm putting a restictive TBI intake and a carb on it. I have three of these engines, all port injected, all waiting to go into Fieros. I will find a way to make it work.||||reg||1
